  "description": "Phat hien loi tich hop giua cac modules: cross-module reference drift, API contract violations, event handler coverage gaps, orphan FK references runtime, multi-platform entity sync issues, cache staleness, state machine errors, business flow violations, authorization matrix missing guards. Tieu thu cross_module_dependencies[] tu req-registry.json + YAML specs (state-machine, business-flow, authorization-matrix). Static probes parallel max 3; runtime probes sequential (DB/API connection limit).",
