  "execution_rationale": "Static probes Wave 2 (cross-module-ref + api-contract-drift + event-handler-coverage) chay PARALLEL max 3 (CORE-025 — static class, no shared state). State-machine + auth-matrix (static, exhaustive) parallel max 2 (YAML parse cheap, parallel safe). Runtime probes SEQUENTIAL: orphan-FK truoc (read-only DB) -> multi-platform sync (curl GET nhieu base_urls) -> cache-staleness (mutation, opt-in) -> business-flow-runtime cuoi cung (E2E flow co the mutate state, cleanup quan trong). Tach 4 groups runtime de tranh DB connection contention + giup resume per-probe checkpoint."
